_worker_picks_up_a_humanitarian_box_to_give_to_an_earthquake_survivor_in_Port-au-Prince.jpg/960px-US_Navy_100125-N-6266K-238_A_Red_Cross_worker_picks_up_a_humanitarian_box_to_give_to_an_earthquake_survivor_in_Port-au-Prince.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","file":"US Navy 100125-N-6266K-238 A Red Cross worker picks up a humanitarian box to give to an earthquake survivor in Port-au-Prince.jpg","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Navy_100125-N-6266K-238_A_Red_Cross_worker_picks_up_a_humanitarian_box_to_give_to_an_earthquake_survivor_in_Port-au-Prince.jpg","provider":"wikimedia","attribution":{"author":"U.S. Navy photo by Mass Communication Specialist 1st Class Joshua Lee Kelsey","license":"Public domain","license_url":null,"source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Navy_100125-N-6266K-238_A_Red_Cross_worker_picks_up_a_humanitarian_box_to_give_to_an_earthquake_survivor_in_Port-au-Prince.jpg"},"width":960,"height":656},"memberships":["volunteering","activity"]},{"category":"volunteering","title":"Oyuncak Dayanışması","description":"Temiz ve kullanılabilir oyuncakların kontrolü, düzenlenmesi ve paylaşılmasına destek ol.","slug":"try","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toy_library","illustrative":true,"cover":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/US_Navy_050115-N-4995T-171_The_last_box_of_donated_toys_from_Operation_Keiki_Aloha_is_loaded_onto_the_High_Speed_Vessel_Two_%28HSV-2%29_Swift_while_in_port_Pearl_Harbor%2C_Hawaii.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","file":"US Navy 050115-N-4995T-171 The last box of donated toys from Operation Keiki Aloha is loaded onto the High Speed Vessel Two (HSV-2) Swift while in port Pearl Harbor, Hawaii.jpg","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Navy_050115-N-4995T-171_The_last_box_of_donated_toys_from_Operation_Keiki_Aloha_is_loaded_onto_the_High_Speed_Vessel_Two_(HSV-2)_Swift_while_in_port_Pearl_Harbor,_Hawaii.jpg","provider":"wikimedia","description":"Pearl Harbor, Hawaii (Jan. 15, 2005) - The last box of donated toys from Operation Keiki Aloha is loaded onto the High Speed Vessel Two (HSV-2) \"Swift\" while in port Pearl Harbor, Hawaii. Operation Keiki Aloha is the name of a toy donation drive conducted by the Naval Station Pearl Harbor Navy Exchange. HSV-2 Swift is currently in port in Pearl Harbor, Hawaii prior to arriving in South East Asia in support of Operation Unified Assistance, the humanitarian operation effort in the wake of the Tsunami. Swift is home ported at Naval Station Ingleside, Texas and responded on short notice to meet the needs of the humanitarian and disaster relief efforts. U.S. Navy photo by Photographer's Mate 3rd Class Victoria A. Tullock (RELEASED)","attribution":{"author":"U.S. Navy photo by Photographer's Mate 3rd Class Victoria A. Tullock","license":"Public domain","license_url":null,"source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Navy_050115-N-4995T-171_The_last_box_of_donated_toys_from_Operation_Keiki_Aloha_is_loaded_onto_the_High_Speed_Vessel_Two_(HSV-2)_Swift_while_in_port_Pearl_Harbor,_Hawaii.jpg"},"width":960,"height":686},"memberships":["volunteering","activity"]},{"category":"volunteering","title":"Bisiklet Dayanışması","description":"Gönüllü ekiplerle kullanılmayan bisikletlerin onarılıp yeniden kullanılmasına katkı ver.","slug":"try","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bicycle_cooperative","illustrative":true,"cover":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Sopo_Bicycle_Cooperative.jpg/960px-Sopo_Bicycle_Cooperative.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","file":"Sopo Bicycle Cooperative.jpg","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sopo_Bicycle_Cooperative.jpg","provider":"wikimedia","attribution":{"author":"Timothy J Carroll","license":"CC BY 2.0","license_url":"https://c